                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <code className="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-blue-700">
                        @company
                      </code>{" "}
                      — sostituito con l&apos;azienda del cliente
                    </li>
                    <li>
                      <code className="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-blue-700">
